Draft patch — PR #36 retry publication (CONFIRMED, verdicts.md item 36). The retry workspace-reuse UPDATE set only state='active', leaving the predecessor's published_commit in place; create_pull_request gates only on published_commit IS NOT NULL and would use the predecessor's commit as the retry run's PR head. Clears published_commit/published_at/published_by_actor_id/publish_failure_category on reuse (the 0022 publication shape constraint requires the first three to be nulled together), so publication must be re-earned by the retry run. Uncompiled in the authoring sandbox; run cargo check + scheduler tests before landing.

